ay of any kind of items and will automatically generate its cells from these items. ","type":"text"},{"code":"SCArrayOfItemsModel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will automatically generate a set of SCArrayOfItemsSection(s) if the sectionHeaderTitleForItem modelAction is implemented, otherwise it will only generate a single SCArrayOfItemsSection.","type":"text"}]},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsModel/tempSection":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsModel\/tempSection","title":"tempSection","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"tempSection","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The section temporarily being edited."}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemsmodel\/tempsection"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class functions as an SCTableViewModel section that is able to represent an array"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of any kind of items and automatically generate its cells from these items. The section"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also able to handle all end-user interaction with the generated cells, including adding,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing, deleting, and moving the cells. When cells are added or edited, detail views are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically generated for this purpose. To enable adding cells, the class’ user should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"}}}